Toi thay mot vector manh hon review truoc: `/snippet` va `/snippet/update` co the parse URL duoi `wp-content/uploads` va noi thang vao `basedir`, khong chan `..`, sau do doc file va dua vao ZIP upload len Kubio cloud. Toi dang kiem tra them khoa API/flow cloud de danh gia xem day la TP multisite doc file hay van con thieu mot dieu kien quan trong.
