codex
Da ghi Phase 2 JSON vao [reports/phase2/kubio-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/kubio-phase2.codex.json).

Ket qua hien tai: `0` TP, `2` REVIEW, `6` FP, `2` out-of-scope. Hai diem can review them la:
- `/snippet` co trace `snippet` -> path ghép tu `basedir` -> `file_get_contents()` -> ZIP upload len Kubio cloud; can dynamic check de xac nhan exfil thuc te.
- demo-site plugin install/activate chi gate bang `import` thay vi `install_plugins` / `activate_plugins`; can xac minh deployment role semantics, nhat la multisite.

Toi da validate file JSON bang `jq`.
